o add more of morning light. The scene has broad beams and bright table. Nice.\n\nTable leg fix:\nLeft leg path and highlight: x +3:\n`M237 453 H283 L277 643 C277 650 271 653 264 653 H253 C245 653 240 649 239 643 Z`\nHighlight M239 ... H246, etc. This shifts just 3.\nRight leg path +16:\n`M745 453 H791 L788 643 ... H764 C757... 751...` Need height top. Use:\n`M745 453 H791 L788 643 C788 649 783 653 775 653 H764 C757 653 752 649 751 643 Z`.\nHighlight M746 461 H755 L754 640 C754 646 751 650 747 650 L746 643 Z.\nLegs now centers 260/768 symmetric.\nBut table legs may end up at outer edges relative to apron (230..798). Fine.\nApron adjust x=230..798:\n- rect 230 y454 w568 h35.\n- highlight 230..798.\n- shadow 230..798.\n- decorative line x=374..654 centered 514.\n- knob x=500 width28.\nWould right leg attach near 768 under apron, left at 260. Symmetric. Do.\nCurrent apron path `M226 454 H794 V489 H226 Z`. Update.\nLine `M339 464 H627` -> `M374 464 H654`. Center 514, width 280.\nKnob `x=473` -> `x=500`.\n- Could add two vertical boards symmetrical? no.\n\nTable top center is 514; good.\n\n- Table's visible front apron maybe unbalanced because front legs; fixed.\n\nPaper and mug gap: shift mug -10. Update group transform:\n`<!-- Blue mug --> <g transform=\"translate(-10 0)\">` and close group at end of mug (line before Folded newspaper). The mug shadow adjust.\nMug shadow ellipse cx 528 -> 520 maybe. Rx 51. Also cast shadow entire mug shift.\nMaybe shift apples left by 2? not needed. The apples cluster center ~338, mug center 502; paper cat. The objects fill width. \nAfter shifting mug, steam at 484,490 etc, fine.\nMug left edge 462; apple right edge 424 + shadow; gap 38, still.\nPaper gap 11. Nice.\n\nBut mug and apples: all items still \"on table\". Good.\n\nFold corner maybe still looks like a napkin. Could add black newspaper text more clearly? The fold hides some. It's okay.\n\nNeed maybe make cat less large? It's about 200px, which is huge for a table with mug. A real cat larger than a mug. Fine.\n\nCat coloring: The body is quite blue-gray (#878B87). User wants gray cat. yes.\n\nLet's apply fixes."}
